## BxRig: the desktop

#### Two desktops, one command set

- Hyprland + Noctalia is the main desktop (`bxrig setup hyprland`). KDE Plasma stays installed; `bxrig setup plasma` adds HyprKwin tiling (`bxrig tiling on|off|status|layout NAME`).
- Plasma panels: `bxrig plasma panels apply|undo|status` (top status panel, bottom dock, Panel Colorizer islands; backed up first). `bxrig plasma desktops N` sets virtual desktops. Workspaces default to 4.

#### Shortcuts

- One table drives xremap, Hyprland and Plasma. `bxrig keys show|sheet|check|conflicts`, `keys set ID COMBO --yes`, `keys reset ID --yes`. Never edit `bxrig.lua` by hand.
- Cmd-style keys (Super plus Z X A S F T N O P R W L B I U comma) become Ctrl keys in apps; terminals keep shell keys safe. Toggle with `bxrig keys mac`.
- Useful: `Super+Alt+M` control center, `Super+K` cheat sheet, `Super+Shift+3/4/5` screenshots, `Super+Ctrl+E` emoji, `Super+Alt+Escape` force quit, `Super+Ctrl+Up` overview, `Super+M` minimize.

#### Everyday commands

- Screenshots: `screenshot screen|region|window [--edit]`, `screenshot ocr`, `screenshot qr`, `qr TEXT`. Recording: `record toggle [--region]`. Clipboard: `clipboard pick`.
- Themes: `theme list|show NAME|set NAME [--mode=theme|dark|light|auto]|random|next|mode M|install GIT_URL|import PATH|remove NAME|status`. Omarchy-format themes (15 bundled, others found on disk or installed from git) colour Noctalia, terminals, btop, Hyprland borders and Neovim; it acts at once, `--dry-run` shows the plan.
- Notifications: `notify dnd on|off|toggle`, `notify snooze 30m`, `notify clear`. Night shift: `nightshift on|off|toggle`.
- `emoji`, `forcequit`, `window minimize|restore`, `overview`, `input gestures --yes`, `airplay on|off`.
- Bar, dock, windows, fonts, monitors, power, time zone: see the `bxrig-system` skill.
- `bxrig menu` is the control center (`menu search TEXT` finds an entry); `bxrig apps` the all-apps window; `bxrig runner` chooses the launcher and menu program.' & chr( 10 );
